meta {
  name: Generate Manifest
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/v1/external/manifests/generate
  body: json
  auth: inherit
}

body:json {
  {
    "shipment_id": []
  }
}

docs {
  Using this API, you can generate the manifest for your order.
  This API generates the manifest and displays the download URL of the same.

  **Note:**

  - Multiple ids can also be passed as an array for bulk generation of manifests.

  - AWB must be assigned and pickup requested on the shipment id to generate manifest.

  ##### Parameters:

  | **PARAMS** | **REQUIRED** | **DATA TYPE** | **DESCRIPTION** | **EXAMPLE** |
  |---|---|---|---|---|
  | `shipment_id` | YES | _integer_ | The shipment id of the order. Multiple ids can be passed as an array, separated by commas. | [16090109] |
}
